<title>USA: Amnex obtains revolving credit line.</title>
<headline>Amnex obtains revolving credit line.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMNEX Inc said on Tuesday that it has obtained a $5.0 million, three-year loan commitment from CIT Group/Credit Finance Inc.</p>
<p>This financing is secured by the company's payphone receivables, AMNEX said.</p>
<p>The credit line provides an immediate $3.5 million of additional liquidity at a lower interest rate than its past indebtedness, AMNEX said in a statement.</p>
</text>
